0,Nigerian Defence Academy - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nigerian_Defence_Academy,"The Nigerian Defence Academy (NDA) is a military university based in Kaduna, Nigeria, that trains officer cadets for commissioning into one of the three services of the Nigerian Armed Forces: the Army, the Navy, and the Air Force.",Nda’nda’,Niger-Congo
